OL,3,AUS removes all bombers from RAF
OL,4,AFairford base
OL,5,
OL,6,FFive men were initially arrested on
OL,7,Fsuspicion of terror offences and
OL,8,Fsubsequently released on bail. A sixth
OL,9,Fman, a UK-Iranian national, was also
OL,10,Flater arrested and released on bail.
OL,23,APub: 04-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG4/39
