OL,3,AAndrew takes legal action over search
OL,4,Awarrants before his arrest
OL,5,
OL,6,FThames Valley Police confirmed: "We are
OL,7,Fengaged in legal proceedings in
OL,8,Frelation to warrants previously
OL,9,Fobtained from the Central Criminal
OL,10,FCourt."
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG6/39
