OL,3,AJewish Greens chair says she could
OL,4,Aleave party over 'Zionism is racism'
OL,5,Amotion
OL,6,
OL,7,FAsked by BBC Radio 4's Today programme
OL,8,Fabout her future, Lichtenstein said: "I
OL,9,Fhaven't decided yet...It is quite
OL,10,Fpossible that I will leave the
OL,11,Fparty...I'm giving it a little time and
OL,12,Fto talk with colleagues."
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG8/39
