OL,3,A'Not again': Arrest of US marine for
OL,4,Amurder reignites protests in Japan's
OL,5,AOkinawa
OL,6,
OL,7,FFor many Okinawa locals, the arrest of
OL,8,Fa US soldier accused of robbing and
OL,9,Fkilling a woman in a hotel room has
OL,10,Freignited decades of frustration over
OL,11,Fcrimes involving US military personnel
OL,12,Fthere.
OL,14,F"Honestly my first reaction was, 'Not
OL,15,Fagain,'" 52-year-old longtime Okinawa
OL,16,Fresident Ai Sato told the BBC.
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,315,300,200,140,0,100
